        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/898d66/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-10-26T09:24:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi all.&nbsp; While browsing the forum someone mention that the Tactics minis are made from the same material as Reaper's Bone line.&nbsp; Bone Minis does not need to be prime so I was wonder if this would apply to the Tactics minis as well.&nbsp; I've seen a lot of topics about priming Tactics so I was wondering if something about them are difference from Bone or people did not realize this fact.</p>",
